1
00:00:00,899 --> 00:00:05,846
This video is for branch managers. Your account shows only your branch:

2
00:00:05,846 --> 00:00:11,699
its requests, its lab cases, its custody tools, and its complaints. It is view only.

3
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:16,810
Sign in with your name and password. Your branch appears next to your name.

4
00:00:19,938 --> 00:00:26,998
The Overview shows this month in numbers: how many requests, how many are received, and how many are still open.

5
00:00:27,449 --> 00:00:33,039
Below, you see the trend over the last months, and the requests of each clinic in your branch.

6
00:00:33,489 --> 00:00:38,049
Tap any request to see its items, its stages, and its comments.

7
00:00:38,499 --> 00:00:44,189
Follow-up shows late requests in your branch: who is holding each one, and for how long.

8
00:00:44,641 --> 00:00:48,291
Tap Nudge to send a reminder to whoever is holding the request.

9
00:00:50,973 --> 00:00:55,966
Reports gives you the month for your branch: by clinic, by doctor and by item.

10
00:00:55,966 --> 00:00:58,463
You can print it or export it to Excel.

11
00:01:00,269 --> 00:01:06,579
Lab KPIs show your branch cases: turnaround, on-time rate, redos and overdue work.

12
00:01:07,030 --> 00:01:13,510
The Custody dashboard shows the tools in your clinics, any shortage against the standard, and the open tickets.

13
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:18,260
Complaints shows the problems reported in your branch, and whether they are solved.

14
00:01:19,528 --> 00:01:24,948
That's it. Check your branch every day, and nudge anything that is late. Thank you!
